My Voice AI 🎙️

My Voice AI is an AI-powered voice cloning and text-to-speech application.

🚀 Project Goal

Our goal is to build a user-friendly web application and Android app that allows users to generate speech using their own voice or a voice they have explicit permission to use.

✨ Planned Features

- Record or upload voice samples.
- Create an AI voice model with user consent.
- Convert text into speech using the authorized voice.
- Download generated audio in MP3 format.
- Simple and user-friendly interface.
- Public access for multiple users.

🔒 Privacy and Safety

- Only personal or explicitly authorized voices are allowed.
- User voice recordings must be handled securely.
- Voice models must not be used without permission.

🛠️ Technology

- Python
- AI Voice Cloning
- Text-to-Speech (TTS)
- Web Development
- Android PWA

